notes.body:
We should probably add a line to the New Protocol Support section of doc/release-notes.adoc.

I had not even considered that MAC frames wouldn't fit into the UDP limit.  I am happy to merge this, but there is an argument for registering a proper DLT definition - what do you think?

@stigbjorlykke @pquantin @AndersBroman ?

